346:    A \emph{randomly perturbed graph} $G^p = G_\alpha \cup \Gnp$ is obtained by taking a~deterministic $n$-vertex graph $G_\alpha = (V, E)$ with minimum degree $\delta(G)\geq \alpha n$  
